rule overspend v1
description "Flags spending past a limit. The first row asks for more than 50 pounds over a limit of at least 20 on a bill of at most 60: some input meets each condition, but the subtraction never brings all three together"

enum flag = ok | alert

inputs
  amount : money[GBP]  range >=1GBP <=100GBP
  limit  : money[GBP]  range >=0GBP <=100GBP

outputs
  status : flag

derive excess : money[GBP] = amount - limit  range >=-1000GBP <=1000GBP

table flag_of
policy first
| excess | amount  | limit   | -> status : flag |
| >50GBP | <=60GBP | >=20GBP | alert            |
| >50GBP | -       | -       | alert            |
| -      | -       | -       | ok               |
